  m_text: "Lazare Grandetaille was born in Ajaccio, France. Since he first began
    making friends, his pride and need to control situations became apparent, which
    made him lose those friends. When Lazare turned 18, in the middle of the war,
    he pronounced himself King Napoleon III in front of an almost empty country in
    order to get the respect he thought he deserved. \r\n\r\nSpecial effects:\r\nKing
    Napoleon III \r\n"
